the bounded DFA ladder problem:"]}, "id": "BB_2", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "prediction-changed"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 2.659965034965033, "y": 75.80419580419563, "width": 46.62762237762239, "height": 9.79020979020992, "rotation": 0}, "id": "CtIkd1oybW", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 2.659965034965033, "y": 75.80419580419563, "width": 46.62762237762239, "height": 9.79020979020992, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["text"]}, "id": "CtIkd1oybW", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 2.659965034965033, "y": 75.80419580419563, "width": 46.62762237762239, "height": 9.79020979020992, "rotation": 0, "text": ["Space analysis:\nEach recursive level uses space O(n) (to record w)."]}, "id": "CtIkd1oybW", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 2.5034965034965038, "y": 31.46853146853147, "width": 69.8631993006993, "height": 43.21678321678321, "rotation": 0}, "id": "QbSNtOfSed", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 2.5034965034965038, "y": 31.46853146853147, "width": 69.8631993006993, "height": 43.21678321678321, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["equation"]}, "id": "QbSNtOfSed", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 2.5034965034965038, "y": 31.46853146853147, "width": 69.8631993006993, "height": 43.21678321678321, "rotation": 0, "text": ["BOUNDED-LADDER_DFA = {(B, u, v, b) | B a DFA and u \u2192_b v by a ladder in L(B)}\n\nB-L = \"On input (B, u, v, b) Let m = |u| = |v|.\n1. For b = 1, accept if u, v \u2208 L(B) and differ in \u2264 1 place, else reject.\n2. For b > 1, repeat for each w \u2208 L(B) of length |u|\n3. Recursively test u \u2192_b/2 w and w \u2192_b/2 v [division rounds up]\n4. Accept both accept.\n5. Reject [if all fail].\"\n\nTest (B, u, v) \u2208 LADDER_DFA with B-L procedure on input (B, u, v, t) for t = |\u03a3|^m"]}, "id": "QbSNtOfSed", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 72.28846153846155, "y": 38.04195804195804, "width": 26.36494755244756, "height": 38.881118881118894, "rotation": 0}, "id": "7PHpJMv2fl", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 72.28846153846155, "y": 38.04195804195804, "width": 26.36494755244756, "height": 38.881118881118894, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["image"]}, "id": "7PHpJMv2fl", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 49.99169580419581, "y": 79.58041958041959, "width": 41.46416083916085, "height": 11.88811188811188, "rotation": 0}, "id": "ZejaSuCbu4", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 49.99169580419581, "y": 79.58041958041959, "width": 41.46416083916085, "height": 11.88811188811188, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["image"]}, "id": "ZejaSuCbu4", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "manual"}], "created_username": "12. Doshisha nlp_annot_12@naist.ac.jp, 18", "created_ago": "1\u00a0minute", "completed_by": {"id": 18, "